+| Diagnostic | Shipped mismatches, original / optimized | With one call replaced, original / optimized |
+| --- | ---: | ---: |
+| softmax, 187 outputs each | 81 / 68 | 0 / 0 |
+| attention, 143 outputs each | 86 / 82 | 0 / 0 |
+| mlp, 143 outputs each | 21 / 24 | 0 / 0 |
